/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (In conclusion, the Banking Management System successfully addresses the challenges of securing financial operations and managing user permissions in a modern, scalable web environment. By integrating JWT-based stateless authentication and Role-Based Access Control \(RBAC\), the system ensures that only authorized users can perform sensitive actions such as managing accounts or deleting profiles. This approach provides both robust protection and the flexibility needed in enterprise-grade applications.)
/E (In conclusion, the Banking Management System successfully addresses the challenges of securing financial operations and managing user permissions in a modern, scalable web environment. By integrating JWT-based stateless authentication and Role-Based Access Control \(RBAC\), the system ensures that only authorized users can perform sensitive actions such as managing accounts or deleting profiles. This approach provides both robust protection and the flexibility needed in enterprise-grade applications.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
